---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import {site} from '../config/site';
const updates = (await getCollection('news')).sort((a,b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<section id="nieuws" class="community wrap section-space"><div class="community-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HET PRIKBORD</p><h2>Er groeit iets moois.</h2><p>Nieuwe builds, spelersshops en verhalen uit de buurt. Je vindt ze hier zodra we van start gaan.</p></div>{updates.slice(0,1).map(({data}) => <article class="community-note"><div class="note-label">{data.category}<span>{data.preview ? 'BINNENKORT' : 'NIEUWS'}</span></div><h3>{data.title}</h3><p>{data.summary}</p><a class="text-link" href={site.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Laat van je horen op Discord <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</section>
